WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:08.440
<i>A pure life begins with a pure mind.</i>

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.190
<i>My name is Amatsuyu Kisaragi.</i>

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.570
Good morning, Joro!

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.280
Ow!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.580
Himawari!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.660
Thanks for your help with the midterm!

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.210
Sun-chan and I both passed!

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.500
Apologize to me before you thank me!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.710
I always tell you, don't slap me
in the back first thing in the morning!

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.340
True, you always do tell me that!
So tell me tomorrow, too!

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.180
Go to hell!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.640
- Why decide now to slap me tomorrow?
- After all...

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.510
we're old friends!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.310
Joro!

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.020
<i>What are you going to do?</i>

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:23.700
EPISODE 05
I THOUGHT IT WAS WORKING OUT
TOO WELL FOR ME

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.200
Morning!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.160
<i>Good morning, Joro!
Can I meet with you later today?</i>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:30.120
<i>There's something I can only tell you.</i>

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.590
<i>Is this the world of a rom-com protagonist?</i>

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.550
<i>Sheesh. Even if there were two of me,
it wouldn't be enough.</i>

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.590
Good morning, Joro!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.510
Do you have a minute?

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.180
What's up, Asunaro?

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.680
Actually, there's something I want to tell you.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.520
Please come with me!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.650
<i>Oh, come on. Seriously?</i>

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.030
Okay, so?

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:04.490
U-Um...

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.420
Wh-What did you want to tell me?

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.960
Um, actually...

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.090
I...

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.760
I'm really curious about you!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.510
<i>Ecstasy!</i>

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:25.970
Nice catch!

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:27.930
<i>A new addition!</i>

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.020
<i>Striped panties and ponytail!</i>

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.810
Um...

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.900
I don't want to be standing around like this.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.490
- Let's go over there.
- Sure.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.330
<i>Shudder!</i>

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.830
<i>Why?</i>

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.420
<i>The mind-boggling bench!</i>

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.340
<i>Why? Why? Why is it there?</i>

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.180
Joro...

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.890
<i>W-Wait.</i>

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.010
Um...

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:11.230
first, would you sit next to me?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.690
<i>Don't say that line!</i>

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:17.610
<i>But remember, I'm not
the same person I was yesterday!</i>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.690
<i>Believe in your own strength!</i>

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.200
Here.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.120
S-Sure.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.950
U-Um...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.960
So actually...

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.040
I've always been curious about you, Joro.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:40.380
<i>Is this it?</i>

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:44.340
When I think about you, my chest feels tight.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:48.260
But I'm just thrilled
that I get to see you every day.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:51.520
<i>It's okay!
You're the protagonist of a rom-com!</i>

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.850
<i>Have faith in yourself!</i>

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.150
Joro, you're...

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:02.030
a sleazy scumbag,
the worst-ever enemy of all women!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.240
Pardon?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:10.990
Joro, right now you're stringing along
Himawari, President Cosmos, and Sanshokuin!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:15.040
<i>H-How does she know,
when it isn't even reality yet?</i>

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:20.540
It all started last year, at the final game
of the regional baseball championship.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.510
<i>That again?!</i>

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:28.140
I was in the stands by first base,
cheering the team on,

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:34.600
while you were sitting a little ways away,
leering at a beautiful girl.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:39.150
There was definitely
that perverted thing in your eyes!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.980
<i>"Thing"?</i>

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.360
What I'm saying is you're a pervert
whose morals have been blacked out by lust!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.660
That's how you can have three girlfriends!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:51.990
Y-You could tell just from that
Look, I don't have three girlfriends.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.330
I've got proof right here.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.290
Huh?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.170
You may be old friends,
but friends aren't that close.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.000
Huh?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.500
Is that the hard sell of love?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.300
- It's nauseating.
- Huh?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.420
And here, matching cups.
You're truly disgusting.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:10.800
Wait, l-look, these are all real photos,
but there isn't anything between us.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.890
Please, use your common sense.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:20.100
A man makes like lovebirds
with multiple women.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.440
Yet he insists that none of them
are special relationships.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:27.280
- The only one to get away with that...
- Th-The only one to get away with that...

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.030
...is the protagonist of a rom-com!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.530
<i>Reality is killing me!</i>

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.200
Joro, this is your trial!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.080
AMATSUYU KISARAGI, KING OF THE SCUMBAGS!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.080
CURRENTLY VIOLATING 3 WOMEN!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.250
What is this?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.080
CURRENTLY VIOLATING 3 WOMEN!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.080
Don't worry!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.670
When I distribute the paper,
girls' names will be omitted.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.130
But you're not giving me a bit of consideration.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.050
I-It really isn't true!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:53.550
I didn't think you would deny it so stridently.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:58.140
As a member of the newspaper staff,
I can't afford to disseminate false information.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.640
R-Right? So—

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.520
Then, let's do this!

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:07.650
Starting today,
I'll shadow you until the Flower Festival.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:12.410
And if I find you innocent,
then I won't distribute this article.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:16.450
O-On the other hand, if you judge me guilty...

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.250
I'll take advantage
and give it out at the Flower Festival,

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.170
where there'll be a huge crowd,
including parents.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.880
Your kindness is crushing me.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.590
So thank you for your cooperation
in advance, Joro!

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.130
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:40.560
<i>Anyway, right now I need to steer clear
of events as much as I can.</i>

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.390
Hi.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.310
Joro!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.070
I came to see you, like we planned.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.400
L-Like we planned?

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.040
Ta-da! Look at this.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:04.540
It was a totally random lottery, but you were
picked to be the boy for the Flower Dance!

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.500
GIRLS: SAKURA AKINO, 3RD-YEAR,
AOI HINATA 2ND-YEAR,
KIMIE KAMATA, 1ST-YEAR

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.540
BOY: AMATSUYU KISARAGI, 2ND-YEAR

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.540
GIRLS: SAKURA AKINO, 3RD-YEAR,
AOI HINATA 2ND-YEAR,
KIMIE KAMATA, 1ST-YEAR

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.790
<i>There it is, Murphy's Law!</i>

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.170
The Flower Dance.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.670
Isn't that the event at the Flower Festival

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:16.140
where one boy dances with three girls
one after another?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.430
Right, but who are you talking to, Joro?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:25.690
Incidentally, the girls are me,
Himawari, and a first-year, Kamata.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.310
<i>Of all things right now,</i>

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.530
<i>I'll take part in a dance
with three lovely girls!</i>

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.280
There's also a legend that says
the boy from that dance

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:38.780
will get married to one
of the three girls, so maybe...

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.000
you and I...

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.660
Just kidding.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.540
<i>Don't smile at me like that right now!</i>

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.790
- Um, I'm going to decline.
- I can't wait!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:52.590
I turned it down my first two years,
but when I heard you got picked for this year,

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.800
I said I'd do it without even thinking!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.850
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.970
No. It's nothing.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.850
Let's do our best together.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.060
<i>Oh! Nice PDA!</i>

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.820
<i>But this is a rom-com with tears!</i>

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:15.280
He's got the unattainable President Cosmos
this hung up on him?

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.280
Well, I'll see you later!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.290
"Lust that's never been seen before."

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.920
"Women deceived by high school Svengali!"

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.500
The headlines write themselves.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.630
I need you to leave me alone for a while!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:33.630
- Forget it.
- Forget it.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.760
Are you stupid?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.180
You and I are always together, Joro!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:41.640
There's the Flower Dance,
so we need you for that.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.470
And...

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.720
I'd be lonely without you.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.600
She thinks you've got three girlfriends?

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.810
Then, you can nip it in the bud
if we get engage—

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.650
Denied.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.770
At least let me finish my sentence.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:52.730
I refuse!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.360
Sun-chan!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.650
Sorry, Joro.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:00.820
There's something else I have to do,
so I don't think I can be much help here.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:07.250
My only chance to ask for advice is during lunch,
when Asunaro is holed up in her club room.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:12.800
AMATSUYU KISARAGI
PURE PURITY PLAN

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:13.300
- If she passes out that article, you all will also be—
- It's all right.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:16.470
No matter what anyone says to us,
we won't care.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.760
- Yeah!
- That's right.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:24.220
Okay, I get it. But so you know, I'm not going to
associate with you any more than I have to.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.350
Understood.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.640
I'm fully satisfied with that.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:34.570
Sun-chan should have had some cookies
before he went off to his baseball meeting.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.740
<i>He didn't have any of these, either?</i>

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.740
Yummy!

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.200
Oh, yeah, Joro...

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.410
are you free after school?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.410
Why? What's up?

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:49.500
Actually, I haven't told the final member,
Kamata, about the Flower Dance.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.250
I thought it would be a good chance
for you to meet her.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:56.590
I have no intention of getting involved
with this any more than is necessary, so...

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:59.260
Oh, okay. Yeah, that makes sense.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.390
I was really looking forward to this...

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.850
but now I just feel alone.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.720
I don't want to do it by myself.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.560
I wish you would go with me, Joro.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.770
<i>Is she being manipulative?</i>

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.020
Glance.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.150
I'll go with you.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:17.900
Really, for real?

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:19.900
I'm thrilled to hear that! Thank you!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.120
But I've got one favor to ask.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:25.580
A favor? What is it?

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.040
Um...

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.000
okay, well...

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.710
Let's check out that new shop
in front of the station.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.170
Joro, where are we going?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.180
To meet the first-year member
of the Flower Dance.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:39.550
Sure.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:42.380
Huh.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:45.180
So your next target is a first-year.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.140
<i>I'm ready for this.</i>

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:52.310
<i>When we meet up after school,
I'm sure Asunaro will be following me.</i>

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:57.820
<i>So to dispel her ridiculous "three girlfriends"
notion, please be as strict with me as possible.</i>

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:01.150
<i>Act like you're giving guidance
to a lower classman.</i>

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.780
<i>Got it! I'm nervous, but I'll give it a shot.</i>

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.200
<i>Okay, I'm counting on you.</i>

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.450
<i>Yep, you can count on me.</i>

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.540
What's this?

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.710
President Cosmos, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.920
You worthless menial!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.930
Mend thy ways!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.010
You make me, your superior, wait upon you?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:34.060
You are a truly disgrace to all men!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.310
<i>What creature is this?</i>

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.400
Well, well, Lady Hanetachi.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.240
Hi.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:44.070
It is lovely to see you today.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:47.240
Um, thank you. You, too.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:52.790
Indeed. As you can see,
I am giving Kisaragi strict guidance.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.250
Yeah, right.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:13:01.590
Then let us move on.
The enemy awaits on the first floor!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.550
<i>Somebody stop this samurai!</i>

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.930
President Cosmos, can I ask you something?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.720
Go ahead, Lady Hanetachi.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:14.390
What happens if a member
of the Flower Dance turns it down?

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.520
Naturally another member
would be sought out.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.770
That's what I thought.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:21.110
<i>I'm not even going to address the samurai.</i>

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.570
Huh? Where is it? My scorebook!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.780
That girl.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.280
Kisaragi, if you would...

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.240
All right, I'll be right back.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.120
- Hi.
- Yes?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.000
Can I talk to you?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.120
I-It's Kisaragi!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:38.000
Wh-What's wrong?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.540
P-Please don't come any closer!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:42.760
There are a lot of rumors going around
about you among the first-years!

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:49.140
<i>Crap! The misunderstanding from before
still lingers down here!</i>

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:53.060
They say you can't help yourself
from licking girls' hallway slippers!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.730
They even call you the "Slipper Man"!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.690
<i>It's your favorite today.</i>

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.820
<i>What? You don't
have to show me that flashback.</i>

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.660
He's not a pervert for nothing.
Even a shoe fetish.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.240
I see. "He can't help himself
from licking hallway slippers.”

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.370
It's not true!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.450
It's fake news!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.790
The Slipper Man is trying to lick me!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.920
It's because I'm cute!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.630
- Because I'm cute!
- I do have feelings that can be hurt.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:24.800
Maybe I really am wrong
about you having three girlfriends.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:30.430
I'm sure there's no girl
who would get cozy with the Slipper Man.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:36.270
Then, this matter is settled!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:39.900
<i>At the cost of the original objective.</i>

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:45.570
<i>Kamata has declined to participate
in the Flower Dance.</i>

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.690
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.150
I'll be with you today, too.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.320
Asunaro, I swear to you.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.200
Yes! You haven't done anything, right, Joro?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.370
Then, why...

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.040
Because I work on the school newspaper!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.750
Once I become curious about something,
I'm not satisfied until I can uncover the truth.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.840
So...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.050
I'd like to continue shadowing you.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.130
Unless you refuse?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:12.550
I-I don't mind.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.010
Thank you!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.350
N-Not at all.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.350
Um, I heard that Kamata declined.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.190
Yeah.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.940
Then, what will happen
with the third girl position?

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.190
I guess they'll look for someone else now.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.650
Um, if that's the case...

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.530
<i>I found a third member for the Flower Dance!</i>

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.910
<i>I'll introduce you at lunch!</i>

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.780
Really?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:35.950
What is it?

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.290
President Cosmos found a new member.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:41.960
That's good, huh?

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:42.790
Yeah!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.590
Let's do our best together!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.340
Um, President Cosmos?

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.220
Yes?

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:58.060
The Flower Dance is an event where one boy
dances in turn with three girls, am I right?

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.390
It's okay! I received permission.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.020
Permission was given?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.270
From today, it's the four of us,
so let's do our best!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.110
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.530
If we get married...

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.240
we'll cross that bridge when we come to it.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.110
<i>Rotten or not, it's still a rom-com.</i>

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.700
All right!
After I change, I've got dance practice.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.160
Huh? Joro, what happened?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.960
Our bodies look really simplified.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:27.340
Yeah, from this point on, the animators' "best"
is somewhat lacking.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.590
Pansy said she would practice with us, too!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.090
So let's get changed!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:37.300
I'll go along with it. Just for today, mind you.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.390
Why would Pansy practice with us?

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.230
Who told her to do that?

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.800
<i>One week to go before the Flower Festival.</i>

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:13.220
<i>The Flower Dance member problem
has been solved.</i>

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.010
<i>Practice has been going smoothly.</i>

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.340
<i>Seems Asunaro's misunderstanding
is clearing up.</i>

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.680
<i>If my luck holds...</i>

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:24.810
<i>Wh-Why am I being visited
by a party of the class's top hierarchy?!</i>

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.650
What the hell are you doing?

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:28.020
You're seriously unbelievable.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.060
What a creep.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.650
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.780
This!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:35.110
AMATSUYU KISARAGI,
KING OF THE SCUMBAGS!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:35.110
CURRENTLY VIOLATING 3 WOMEN!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.150
What the hell is this?!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.070
It was being passed out this morning.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.410
This morning? It was supposed
to be held back until the festival.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:43.250
Aren't you embarrassed to be alive?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.790
Why don't you die three times?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.250
Going by your looks,
this shouldn't even be possible.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.080
Joro!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.500
President Cosmos.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:55.380
U-Um, everyone, listen!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:18:00.100
This article isn't true,
so please, do not buy into it!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.850
How do you know it isn't true, Cosmos?

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:09.270
In fact, what are you
even doing in our classroom?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:12.110
Maybe she's one of the three girls
Joro is going out with!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.900
- What?
- No way.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.570
U-Um, I...

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.410
Please move, President Cosmos!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:23.830
U-Um, about that article,
I mighta been mistaken!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:28.540
I dunno if it's really true or not,
so I wasn't gonna print it yet!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:31.840
That's why I've been trailin' Joro,

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.130
so I could write the truth
for a special Flower Festival edition!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.510
Please believe me, I'm beggin' ya!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.300
If you say so, Asunaro, I believe it.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.430
But if it is true...

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:48.390
I will never forgive any guy who hurts a girl!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.820
Joro, I'm sorry.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.990
When I was workin'
on the newspaper yesterday,

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:59.320
I guess my article got mixed in
with the ones ready to publish.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.780
What's done is done.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.240
Thank you.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.870
Um, Joro?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:07.710
Yes?

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:12.790
I'll go to the newspaper office now
and order them to recall all the—

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:13.670
No need!

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.510
I'll take back all the copies myself right now!

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.470
This is my responsibility!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:21.550
Good grief.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.970
Will she be okay on her own?

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.970
This isn't working out, huh?

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.730
Um, President Cosmos?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:33.860
Joro, I'll do whatever I can for you,
in my own way.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.730
Excuse me.

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:40.200
It seems you'll be better off if I'm not here.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.950
What do you mean?
Sun-chan and Himawari aren't going to...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.960
Yes, they're not going to come here anymore.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.460
Why?

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.960
Joro, I have something important to say.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.800
Let's stop meeting.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:04.010
I'm sorry.
All I've managed to do is make things worse.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.760
You mean this morning's newspaper incident?

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:07.930
Yeah.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.730
Why, you came to the room to help me,
President Cosmos!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:17.480
I appreciate you saying that,
but effort without results is pointless.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:20.150
I've failed.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:24.280
I don't want to make that mistake again,
because the burden would fall on you.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:26.370
But our dance practice.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.200
It'll be okay!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.950
From here on out,
as long as we practice on our own,

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.000
we should be fine for the actual event.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:32.830
But...

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.630
I agree with Cosmos.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:39.380
For the time being,
we should keep our distance.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.130
Are you serious?

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.220
Well, I'd better get going.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:48.180
You should refrain from visiting the library
for a while, too.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:50.600
All right.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:59.230
All right! I'll clear your good name, Joro!

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:01.860
Sorry. I'm going to go home now.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:05.320
Don't you have dance practice after school?

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:08.660
It's complicated,
but we're not doing it anymore. See you.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.160
Is it my fault?

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.200
No. It, um...

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.960
I knew it.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:19.300
Then, I'll help you!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:24.930
By way of apology for all the trouble
I've caused, I'll practice the dance with you!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.260
Are you sure?

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:30.180
Of course! I may not look it,
but I'm confident in my athletic ability.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.390
Okay. Please help me, then.

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:35.850
Sure!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:41.610
One-two-three!
One-two-three! One-two-three!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:46.240
One-two-three! One-two-three!
One-two...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:55.080
What do you say, Joro?
I'm pretty good at that, right?

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.710
Yeah. Let's keep it up.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.750
You got it! You can count on me!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
EPISODE 06
WHEN I NEED TO SAY SOMETHING, I'LL SAY IT.

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.680
When I Need to Say Something, I'll Say It.
